00:16:53.470 --> 00:16:58.447
- Yeah, so after creating
the Folded Map Action Kit,

00:16:59.470 --> 00:17:02.620
a few people who I know from
other States, other cities,

00:17:02.620 --> 00:17:04.340
of course mostly, Midwestern cities

00:17:04.340 --> 00:17:07.700
since we are like the
legacy segregation cities.

00:17:07.700 --> 00:17:12.310
They wanted to adapt it to
their city and so right now,

00:17:12.310 --> 00:17:16.310
I'm working with my Folded
Map partner, Dr. Maria Krysan

00:17:16.310 --> 00:17:19.280
to create, "Find Your Fold."

00:17:19.280 --> 00:17:23.990
