who want to do Folded Map

00:17:31.720 --> 00:17:33.330
in their own city.

00:17:33.330 --> 00:17:34.830
We want people to understand

00:17:34.830 --> 00:17:37.600
that Chicago has a unique grid map

00:17:37.600 --> 00:17:40.440
that affords us the opportunity to compare

00:17:40.440 --> 00:17:44.380
in a very unique way but every
place that has segregation

00:17:44.380 --> 00:17:48.050
has a divide and that divide is your fold.

00:17:48.050 --> 00:17:52.210
And so, if you just get people
from those different sides

00:17:52.210 --> 00:17:54.680
to have a conversation,

00:17:54.680 --> 00:17:57.560
then you can do Folded
Map in your own city.

00:17:57.560 --> 00:18:00.313
So, I'm currently working
on that right now.

00:18:01.500 --> 00:18:02.790
- Great, That sounds fab.

00:18:02.790 --> 00:18:07.790
