00:24:29.160 --> 00:24:31.550
that we talk about with home ownership

00:24:31.550 --> 00:24:36.550
and so my current project is
focusing on making more public

00:24:38.280 --> 00:24:42.650
in an interactive way, the
history of land sale contracts

00:24:42.650 --> 00:24:45.690
and how they played a significant role

00:24:45.690 --> 00:24:50.343
in the current economic
state of Greater Englewood.

00:24:51.420 --> 00:24:54.620
And it kind of all
started with the question

00:24:54.620 --> 00:24:58.480
